      "text": "• fault_detection 0.30 → REAL mutation score\n(mutmut/PIT/Stryker: mutants KILLED, not aimed-at)\n• coverage 0.20 → executed coverage delta\n• + schema/status/auth conformance + flakiness×5\nTPS weights UNCHANGED — only the inputs get real\nnew tool evaluate_run(context_id) · closes the\nassured loop's MEASURE step (was a proxy)",
      "originalText": "• fault_detection 0.30 → REAL mutation score\n(mutmut/PIT/Stryker: mutants KILLED, not aimed-at)\n• coverage 0.20 → executed coverage delta\n• + schema/status/auth conformance + flakiness×5\nTPS weights UNCHANGED — only the inputs get real\nnew tool evaluate_run(context_id) · closes the\nassured loop's MEASURE step (was a proxy)",
