      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IMPLEMENTATION STATUS (2026-09-24) — the diagram is the design; the shipped build is leaner.\nBUILT: 4th A2A agent · run_suite (chunked/polled/resumable) · 3 engines routed by methodology (api·httpx / browser·Playwright / llm-translate) ·\nhome-grown OpenAPI status+schema conformance oracle · multi-env (EXEC_ENVIRONMENTS) + per-env auth (bearer/bearer_fetch/login, secret-ref) ·\nfile-upload (inline base64 fixture) · run ledger (exec_environment·exec_run) · per-run origin egress allow-list · heuristic + JEV-fronted triage (default OFF).\nDEFERRED: MEASURE (coverage-delta · flakiness×5 · mutation) · differential multi-env · JEV heal-accept/flakiness/env-select · TEV feed (evaluate_run) ·\nheavy surveyed tools (Schemathesis / RESTler / Hypothesis / behave / Playwright-MCP / Test-Agents / Healenium / Applitools / Pact).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IMPLEMENTATION STATUS (2026-09-24) — the diagram is the design; the shipped build is leaner.\nBUILT: 4th A2A agent · run_suite (chunked/polled/resumable) · 3 engines routed by methodology (api·httpx / browser·Playwright / llm-translate) ·\nhome-grown OpenAPI status+schema conformance oracle · multi-env (EXEC_ENVIRONMENTS) + per-env auth (bearer/bearer_fetch/login, secret-ref) ·\nfile-upload (inline base64 fixture) · run ledger (exec_environment·exec_run) · per-run origin egress allow-list · heuristic + JEV-fronted triage (default OFF).\nDEFERRED: MEASURE (coverage-delta · flakiness×5 · mutation) · differential multi-env · JEV heal-accept/flakiness/env-select · TEV feed (evaluate_run) ·\nheavy surveyed tools (Schemathesis / RESTler / Hypothesis / behave / Playwright-MCP / Test-Agents / Healenium / Applitools / Pact).",
